:: meera_afternoon_d3
<div class="intimate"><span class="tag">Intimate</span>
You sit cross-legged on Meera's bed, facing each other   the ritual position without kumkum or thread. She takes both your hands. Kavya's hands are almost the same size as hers; yours would have engulfed them. This is closer. More equal.

<div class="dialogue">"How does it feel? All of it."</div>

"Heavy. Everything is softer   the air, the bed, my skin. More detail, more sensation per square inch. And these   " you glance down. "They never stop being there. How do you //do// this every day?"

<div class="dialogue">"We don't think about it. Like you don't think about yours."</div>

"Had. Past tense."

She reaches forward and touches your cheek. Cool fingers. And the sensation is amplified   Kavya's skin registers touch at a resolution yours doesn't. You feel the whorls of her fingerprints against your cheekbone. Individual. Specific.
