:: priya_room_d3
Priya's back from the library with pathology and a need to complain.

<div class="dialogue">"Kavya, apoptosis aur necrosis mein morphological difference kya hai? Under microscope?"<span class="gloss-en">Kavya, what's the morphological difference between apoptosis and necrosis? Under a microscope?</span></div>

Deeper than this morning. "Apoptosis mein cell shrink hoti hai   membrane blebbing, nuclear fragmentation. Necrosis mein swell   membrane rupture, inflammation."<span class="gloss-en">In apoptosis the cell shrinks   membrane blebbing, nuclear fragmentation. In necrosis it swells   membrane rupture, inflammation.</span> You're pattern-matching hard now, stitching etymology to the one time Meera explained it.

<div class="dialogue">"Hmm. Makes sense."</div>

She writes. Then, not looking up:

<div class="dialogue">"Tu aaj bahut alag lag rahi hai. Relaxed. Posture bhi thoda off hai."<span class="gloss-en">You seem really different today. Relaxed. Your posture's a bit off too.</span></div>

You slow down. Right hand. Smaller movements. Less eye contact with Meera. Perform.
