:: mess_priya_d3
Priya joins the table with two pieces of bread and jam, phone in one hand, Instagram loaded. She glances at you.

<div class="dialogue">"Kavya, tu aaj kuch alag dikh rahi hai."<span class="gloss-en">Kavya, you look a bit different today.</span></div>

Your blood turns to ice water. "Kaise alag?"<span class="gloss-en">Different how?</span> Casual. Level. Kavya's deadpan.

<div class="dialogue">"Tera face relaxed hai. Like kuch accha hua hai."<span class="gloss-en">Your face is relaxed. Like something good happened.</span></div>

She shrugs. <div class="dialogue">"Or the poha isn't terrible today. Same thing."</div>

Back to Instagram. The moment passes. But //tu aaj alag dikh rahi hai// sits in your gut like swallowed glass. Priya notices things. She was placed here to notice things.

You slow down. Smaller bites. Right hand. Perform. Perform.
