:: meera_terrace_kiss_d3
<div class="intimate"><span class="tag">Intimate · explicit</span>
You lean forward. She meets you halfway.

Nothing like the backstage kiss fourteen months ago   no stubble friction, no height bending, no angular collision of jaw. It's //soft//. Kavya's fuller lips against Meera's, a larger, gentler contact area. Her lower lip between yours. The taste of her cherry chapstick, the same one always.

Her hand moves to the back of your neck, fingers in Kavya's thick hair, and the scalp sensation cascades down your spine   this body is wired differently, neck and scalp a minefield.

Arousal manifests. Not as hardness   there's nothing to harden. Instead: warmth, deep, spreading, radiating outward from between your legs. A pulse at the clitoris, 8,000 nerve endings announcing themselves like a notification you can't dismiss. Wetness beginning   the body's preparation response, readying for something your conscious mind hasn't approved.

You pull back. Breathing ragged.

<div class="dialogue">"Too much?"</div>

"Not enough." The honesty is involuntary; Kavya's body has weaker emotional firewalls. "But this isn't my body to   Rule One."

She nods. Takes your hand instead. Foreheads touching. For today, this is enough.
