:: meera_terrace_hold_d3
<div class="intimate"><span class="tag">Intimate</span>
You don't lean in. You put your forehead against hers instead. Her hand finds Kavya's hair and stays there, gentle, no escalation.

"Rule One," you say. "And also   I want the first time I kiss you again to be with my own mouth. Whenever we get to be us."

<div class="dialogue">"That's the most romantic thing you've ever said and you said it in Kavya's voice."</div>

"She'd hate that."

You sit like that until the light goes. Her head on your shoulder. Your small arms around her. Six months, and this is enough.
